ulting in zero successes. An upcoming test at her academy requires her to summon a familiar, a servant and partner to support her as a magician. Despite desiring a familiar that would be superior to her constantly mocking classmates, Louise ends up summoning Hiraga Saito, your average Japanese boy. Even with Louise and Saito both unwilling to accept each other, they have no choice. Louise cannot attempt another summoning and Saito cannot return to Japan, and so their life together begins. Based on the novel by Noboru Yamaguchi."},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":69,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slavery","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Maids","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Language Barrier","rank":45,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":26,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anachronism","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Familiar of Zero","english":"The Familiar of Zero","native":"ゼロの使い魔","romaji":"Zero no Tsukaima","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"零之使魔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"零之使魔 第一季"}]},"trailer":{"id":"j-UofYKswhI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/j-UofYKswhI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}